A table longer than a sheet: its header row repeats atop the continuation (plan P3-14).

#!table(cols: [{width: "auto"}, {width: "1fr"}], header: 1, rules: "booktabs")
Item | Description
one | the first row of a table that is long enough to need two sheets
two | the second row
three | the third row
four | the fourth row
five | the fifth row
six | the sixth row
seven | the seventh row
eight | the eighth row
#table!
